 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each employee is [id, managerId, name] with a unique id; exactly one employee (the CEO) has managerId equal to its own id, every other managerId names an employee, and every management chain reaches the CEO. Return the chart as one string: one line per employee, each line the employee's name prefixed by four dashes per level below the CEO, lines joined by \"\\n\" with no trailing newline. The order is depth-first from the CEO, each manager followed by its direct reports in their order in the input list.",
